{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44719","headline":"远公 · 灵一","name":"远公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远公逢道安，一朝弃儒服。\n真机久消歇，世教空拘束。\n誓入罗浮中，遂栖庐山曲。\n禅经初纂定，佛语新名目。\n鉢帽绝朝宗，簪裾翻拜伏。\n东林多隐士，爲我辞荣禄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}